# Training web

- Use TypeScript, functional components, and server components by default. [why: client components were added for static markup]
- Keep styling in CSS classes. No `style` and no `CSSProperties`. [why: inline styles bypassed the shared sheet]
- Keep user-visible copy in the content file that owns the screen. [why: poll copy was duplicated in components]
- Poll answer writes use the public CRM key against `PUT /www/v1/polls/{slug}/answers`. [why: the page called the admin API]
